---
layout: layouts/base.njk
desc: "Sarthak Bichhawa, Sr. Data & Applied Scientist at Microsoft Azure Storage. Applied AI and data platforms for incident response, customer health, and revenue attribution."
---

<header class="home-hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Applied AI & data platforms</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">{{ facts.identity.name }}<span class="hero-statement">I make complex systems <em>dependable.</em></span></h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">{{ facts.summary.hero }}</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ facts.resume.file }}" data-goatcounter-click="hero-resume-pdf">Résumé (PDF) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="text-link" href="#work" data-goatcounter-click="hero-work">Selected work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}" data-goatcounter-click="hero-email">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-person">
    <img src="/assets/sarthak.jpg" alt="Sarthak Bichhawa" width="112" height="112" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <div>
      <p class="person-role">{{ facts.identity.title }}</p>
      <p class="person-context">{{ facts.identity.org }} · {{ facts.identity.team }}<br />{{ facts.identity.location }} · Previously Walmart Labs</p>
      <a href="{{ facts.identity.linkedin }}" class="person-link" data-goatcounter-click="hero-linkedin">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="home-assistant wrap" id="assistant" aria-labelledby="assistant-heading" data-portfolio-assistant data-site-url="{{ facts.meta.site_url }}">
  <div class="assistant-canvas">
    <div class="assistant-intro">
      <p class="assistant-kicker"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18M5.6 5.6l12.8 12.8M5.6 18.4 18.4 5.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>AI portfolio assistant</p>
      <h2 id="assistant-heading">Ask about the work.<br /><em>See the evidence.</em></h2>
      <p class="assistant-deck">Explore Sarthak’s experience, or compare his public record with a role.</p>
      <p class="assistant-principle">Answers cite the public record.<br />Gaps stay gaps.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="assistant-workspace">
      <div class="assistant-workspace-head">
        <span class="assistant-source-label"><span aria-hidden="true">◈</span> Grounded in public sources</span>
        <button class="assistant-clear" type="button" id="assistant-clear" disabled>Clear conversation</button>
      </div>
      <div class="assistant-conversation" id="assistant-conversation" role="region" aria-label="Conversation with the AI portfolio assistant" tabindex="0" hidden></div>
      <div class="assistant-welcome" id="assistant-welcome">
        <p class="assistant-welcome-title">Where would you like to start?</p>
        <p>Ask a specific question, or compare a public job description with the experience documented here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="assistant-modes" role="group" aria-label="Assistant mode">
        <button type="button" data-assistant-mode="question" aria-pressed="true">Ask a question</button>
        <button type="button" data-assistant-mode="match" aria-pressed="false">Compare a role <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="assistant-suggestions" id="assistant-suggestions" aria-label="Suggested questions">
        <button type="button" data-assistant-prompt="What has Sarthak shipped with LLM agents?">AI systems shipped <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-assistant-prompt="How has Sarthak led teams and cross-org programs?">Leadership experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-assistant-prompt="What impact has Sarthak had on revenue attribution and customer reliability?">Business & reliability <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </div>
      <form class="assistant-form" id="assistant-form">
        <div id="assistant-question-field" class="assistant-field">
          <label for="assistant-question">Your question</label>
          <textarea id="assistant-question" name="question" rows="3" maxlength="1200" required placeholder="What would you like to know about Sarthak’s work?" aria-describedby="assistant-input-note assistant-privacy assistant-counter"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div id="assistant-match-field" class="assistant-field" hidden>
          <label for="assistant-job">Public job description</label>
          <textarea id="assistant-job" name="jobDescription" rows="5" maxlength="6000" disabled placeholder="Paste the responsibilities and requirements from a public job posting…" aria-describedby="assistant-input-note assistant-privacy assistant-counter"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="assistant-input-meta"><p id="assistant-input-note">Specific questions get the most useful answers.</p><span id="assistant-counter">0 / 1,200</span></div>
        <div class="assistant-submit-row">
          <p id="assistant-status" class="assistant-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Checking availability…</p>
          <button class="assistant-cancel" id="assistant-cancel" type="button" hidden>Stop</button>
          <button class="assistant-send" id="assistant-send" type="submit" disabled><span id="assistant-send-label">Ask the assistant</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <p class="assistant-privacy" id="assistant-privacy">Send only public questions and public job descriptions. Your text is sent to OpenAI through the assistant’s server. Do not include personal or confidential information.</p>
      </form>
      <details class="assistant-about">
        <summary>How this assistant works</summary>
        <div>
          <p>This is an AI portfolio assistant, not Sarthak speaking. It uses a curated set of approved public résumé and portfolio facts, dated {{ facts.meta.resume_rev }}. It links to evidence and says when those facts do not establish an answer. Role comparisons show relevant experience and gaps, without a match score. Writing links are available for you to explore directly.</p>
          <p>Nothing is sent to the model until you choose to send. The server sends your text and up to two earlier questions to OpenAI. Conversation history stays in this tab and clears when you reload or choose “Clear conversation.” <a href="/colophon/#assistant-privacy">Read the processing and privacy details</a>. Replies may contain errors; check the linked sources.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <noscript><p class="assistant-no-script">The assistant needs JavaScript. You can still <a href="/case/">explore the case studies</a>, <a href="/resume/">read the résumé</a>, or <a href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}">contact Sarthak</a>.</p></noscript>
    </div>
    <div class="assistant-record">
      <p class="assistant-record-heading">Explore the public record</p>
      <a href="/resume/">Public résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/case/">Six engineering case studies <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/writing/">Notes from production <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <p class="assistant-revision">Résumé / source revision<br /><time datetime="{{ facts.meta.resume_rev }}">{{ facts.meta.resume_rev }}</time></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <ol class="home-outcomes" aria-label="Selected outcomes">
    {%- for id in facts.homepage.receipts %}
    {%- for r in facts.receipts %}{% if r.id == id %}
    <li><a href="{{ r.anchor }}"><span class="outcome-value">{{ r.value }}</span><span class="outcome-label">{{ r.label }}</span></a></li>
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>

<section class="home-section wrap" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
  <div class="home-section-head">
    <h2 id="work-heading">Selected work</h2>
    <a href="/case/" class="text-link">All six case studies <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <article class="featured-case" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
    <div class="featured-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / Applied AI · In production</p>
      <h3 id="featured-title"><a href="/case/incident-agent/">From an incident alert to an evidence-backed answer.</a></h3>
      <p>An agent that tests competing hypotheses against live telemetry and produces a cited investigation brief.</p>
      <dl class="featured-ownership">
        <div><dt>My role</dt><dd>Design & implementation lead</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Key decision</dt><dd>Own the planner / executor loop</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <a class="case-link" href="/case/incident-agent/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <figure class="featured-system">
      <figcaption class="eyebrow">An investigation</figcaption>
      <ol class="investigation-flow">
        <li><span class="flow-step">01</span><strong>Incident signals</strong><span>Telemetry + deployment state</span></li>
        <li><span class="flow-step">02</span><strong>Planner</strong><span>Competing hypotheses</span></li>
        <li><span class="flow-step">03</span><strong>Executor + tools</strong><span>Test against live evidence</span></li>
        <li><span class="flow-step">04</span><strong>Cited brief</strong><span>Confidence + query references</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="system-example"><strong>The decision that mattered</strong>A recent deployment looked responsible. The agent rejected that theory after checking the telemetry. <a href="/case/incident-agent/#trace">Explore the production replay <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    </figure>
    <details class="featured-decision" id="decisions">
      <summary>Explore the engineering decision <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <div>
        <h4>Own the loop. Make every conclusion traceable.</h4>
        <p>I replaced the initial framework with a planner / executor loop to control tracing, retries, and context compaction. The trade-off: more orchestration code to maintain. A golden-set evaluation harness gates changes, and the final brief links claims to supporting queries.</p>
        <a href="/case/incident-agent/#decision" class="case-link">Architecture, evaluation, and lessons <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </details>
  </article>
  <div class="supporting-cases">
    <article aria-labelledby="revenue-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / Revenue systems</p>
      <h3 id="revenue-title"><a href="/case/revenue-attribution/">Making the numbers trustworthy.</a></h3>
      <p>I traced a silent attribution failure through 20+ components, drove six months of backfills, and redesigned the engine.</p>
      <p class="supporting-result">{{ facts.receipts[0].value }} in attribution recovered · &lt;1% variance vs Finance</p>
      <a href="/case/revenue-attribution/" class="case-link">Read the recovery <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </article>
    <article aria-labelledby="health-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / Customer intelligence</p>
      <h3 id="health-title"><a href="/case/customer-health-agent/">Answers at the speed of a question.</a></h3>
      <p>I built an agent that turns plain-English questions into governed telemetry queries and review-ready narratives across 13 metric domains.</p>
      <p class="supporting-result">{{ facts.receipts[3].value }} for executive-review preparation</p>
      <a href="/case/customer-health-agent/" class="case-link">Explore the agent <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section wrap" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
  <div class="leadership-story">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Experience & leadership</p><h2 id="experience-heading">Build the system.<br />Bring the team.</h2></div>
    <div class="leadership-copy">
      <p>At Microsoft, I led a 4-team cross-org severity-2 response during the attribution recovery and aligned 8+ engineering and support teams around one customer-health program.</p>
      <p>Previously at Walmart Labs, I led 4 data scientists and 2 interns to productionize an item-level placement workflow.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/resume/" data-goatcounter-click="exp-resume-page">Full experience & résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ol class="career-strip" aria-label="Career history">
    {% for role in facts.record %}
    <li><a href="/resume/#{{ role.id }}"><strong>{{ role.company }}</strong><span>{{ role.dates }}</span></a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="home-section wrap home-writing" id="writing" aria-labelledby="writing-heading">
  <div class="home-section-head"><h2 id="writing-heading">Notes from production</h2><a href="/writing/" class="text-link">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <ul class="posts">
    {% for w in facts.writing %}{% if w.url %}
    <li><a class="post-row" href="{{ w.url }}"><span class="post-date">{{ w.date | humanDate }}</span><span class="post-title">{{ w.title }}</span><span class="post-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="home-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact-intro">
      <div><h2 id="contact-heading">Let’s build something dependable.</h2><p>Open to senior opportunities in applied AI and ML leadership.</p></div>
      <a href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}" class="btn btn-primary" data-goatcounter-click="contact-email">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-links"><a href="mailto:{{ facts.identity.email }}">{{ facts.identity.email }}</a><a href="{{ facts.identity.linkedin }}">LinkedIn</a><a href="{{ facts.identity.github }}">GitHub</a><a href="{{ facts.resume.file }}">Résumé (PDF)</a></div>
    <details class="disclosure">
      <summary>Plain-text summary, for your notes</summary>
      <div class="disclosure-body">
        <pre id="ats-summary">{{ facts.summary.ats }}
Site: {{ facts.meta.site_url }} · Résumé: {{ facts.meta.site_url }}{{ facts.resume.file }} · LinkedIn: {{ facts.identity.linkedin }} · Email: {{ facts.identity.email }}</pre>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm copy-btn" type="button" data-goatcounter-click="contact-copy-summary">Copy</button>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
